---
title: "C4 Dynamic — Choose once for a subagent task"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Parent agent / harness
  participant A as Harness adapter
  participant E as Local decision engine
  participant S as Evidence cache
  participant P as Selected model provider
  Note over H,P: Proposed integration, Hermes support unverified
  H->>A: Starts subagent with initial task instructions
  A->>E: Requests one pick (instructions, allowed list, constraints)
  alt Decision model succeeds
    E->>S: Reads candidate features and freshness
    E->>E: Filter eligible candidates, score, calibrate, rank
    E-->>A: Pick, confidence and runners-up
    A->>H: Sets model and provider for this subagent
  else Model unavailable, runtime error or timeout
    A->>H: Keeps native subagent default as-is, without Goldilocks constraint checks
  end
  A->>A: Writes mandatory local attempt and selection/fallback record
  H->>P: Sends initial task to selected model
  P-->>H: Returns response or tool requests
  loop Remaining subagent work
    H->>P: Sends follow-up and tool results to same model
    P-->>H: Returns response or tool requests
  end
  Note over H,P: No further Goldilocks calls for this subagent task
  Note over A,E: Empty eligible pool and low confidence are separate policies still open
